# Pairs with DenialsAudited. Read and introspection calls authorize without
# the audited path, so a refused read leaves no denial record.
MODULE: AuditReadDenialUnaudited
TARGET: DenialsAudited
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a refused read call is not audited
PERTURBS: Authorize

--- FIND
finals' = IF w THEN finals \cup {Row(o, "Denied", c, "caller", FALSE, FALSE)} ELSE finals
--- REPLACE
finals' = IF w /\ k # "read" THEN finals \cup {Row(o, "Denied", c, "caller", FALSE, FALSE)} ELSE finals
--- END
